/// Helpers for keeping the optimizer out of a test's way.
#smdl

/// The identity, out of line, so that a value the test wants at run time
/// cannot fold at compile time. Both `noinline` and the absence of `macro`
/// are load-bearing: a macro would expand at the call site and fold
/// straight through.
@(pure noinline)
export auto opaque(const auto x) = x;
